  "raw": " title\n\nOctober's LPGA Tour wins: Rolex Series Most Improved Player of the Year\n\nRolex Series Most Improved Player of the Year Brooke Henderson - Cambia Portland Classic\n\n*ItemThumbnailImage'';_________;_______\\ldailybulletin:\n\nplayer of the year\n\n*, Instead, the homegrown 20-year-old was crowned the American Women's Open champion at Aronimink in Pennsylvania as she makes her bid for a maiden breakthrough Major.In contrast to 2014 amateur breakout star,Michelle Wie, it wasn't the result that won this year's Rolex Series Most Improved Player of the Year award but every aspect of Brooke's game.The teenager, who fell in love with golf at the age of seven while sitting on the sidelines watching her brothers play, has already stepped up to become a top 10 Spanish tour player and on April 10 her LPGA Tour card was docked for one year as part of the post performance enhancvent programme",
